<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; width: 100%"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 0.75in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.5in; text-align: left">(i)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">obtaining the registration of the Company before the <I>Direcci&oacute;n
