    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#8239;</P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in">Hereinafter, the Pre-Closing Stockholders and SWVL Global shall be
jointly referred to as the &ldquo;<B>Stockholders</B>&rdquo; and individually each of them as a &ldquo;<B>Stockholder</B>&rdquo;, which
term shall also include any successors-in-interest of these parties for so long as this Shareholder Agreement is effective.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#8239;</P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in">Hereinafter, the Stockholders and the Company shall be jointly referred
to as the &ldquo;<B>Parties</B>&rdquo; and each one of them as the &ldquo;<B>Party</B>&rdquo;.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#8239;</P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in">The Parties state that they have sufficient legal capacity to enter
into this stockholders&rsquo; agreement (hereinafter, the <B>&ldquo;Shareholder Agreement&rdquo;</B>).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#8239;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>WHEREAS</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#8239;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.5in"><B>I.</B></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">The Company is dedicated to the exploitation, development, implementation, placing on the market and commercialization
of new transport and mobility systems.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#8239;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.5in"><B>II.</B></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">On the date hereof has occurred the Closing under the share purchase agreement executed among the Pre-Closing
Stockholders and SWVL Global on [<B>EXECUTION DATE OF THE SPA TO BE INSERTED</B>] (the &ldquo;<B>SPA</B>&rdquo;), by virtue of which the
SWVL Global has acquired from the Pre-Closing Stockholders 4,476,630 shares of the Company (the &ldquo;<B>SWVL Shares</B>&rdquo;).</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#8239;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.5in"><B>III.</B></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">As a consequence of the execution of the SPA and the acquisition of the SWVL Shares by SWVL Global, the
total number of shares of all classes of stock of the Company is 8,777,706 shares, having each a par value of $0.00001, distributed among
the Stockholders as follows:</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#8239;</P>

