<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Company has embedded the following open-source
technologies into some or all of its products: Java; Spring-boot; Spring Security; Hibernate; Maven; Angular 6; Typescript; Css; MySQL;
Android; Gradle; Nodejs; React native; Redux; Serverless; Lambda; and Php.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#8239;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

